  <h2>Design Leadership</h2>
  <p>
    Spearheaded concept ideation each season by leading brainstorming sessions and rapidly 
    prototyping early designs to validate solutions before committing to full builds. Managed 
    the mechanical design timeline and coordinated with electrical and programming sub-teams.
  </p>

  <h2>Fabrication & Training</h2>
  <p>
    Operated and trained team members on machining, welding, and 3D printing equipment to 
    fabricate custom robot components. Built a culture of hands-on learning where newer members 
    gained real shop skills alongside experienced builders.
  </p>

